Package: opus
Title: ICES DATRAS Data Dictionary and Known-Issues Registry
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-07-29
Authors@R:
    c(person("Einar", "Hjörleifsson",
             email = "einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre")))
Author: Einar Hjörleifsson
Maintainer: Einar Hjörleifsson <einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com>
Description: Reference specifications package consolidating ICES DATRAS data dictionaries
    and known-issues registry. Provides YAML definitions for field types, units, and
    constraints across four Tier-1 exchange tables (HH, HL, CA, LT), plus structured
    tracking of metadata issues for reporting to ICES.
 .
      Data-only package (no computational functions). YAML dictionaries conform to
    the data-dict.yaml v0.1.0 specification. The known-issues registry documents
    gaps and inconsistencies in ICES specifications, distinct from data-quality QC
    (which belongs downstream in obus/imbus).
 .
      Intended for pre-submission validation: data submitters can use opus specs
    locally to validate DATRAS submissions before uploading to ICES.
